From: tyn-patches <tyn-patches@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 09:50:21 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] tyn: centred FixedPos names on half the name width,
 CenteredTwoPiece nametag

Two optional Dialogue profile fields, off by default (no other game changes):

- FixedNameCenterOnHalfWidth: a FixedPos name aligned to the centre is
  centred on NamePos.x + MaxNameWidth / 2 instead of NamePos.x +
  MaxNameWidth. STEINS;GATE 0 (mode 0 of _SYSTEM: FixedPos, centred, NamePos
  (200, 678), MaxNameWidth 880 in 1280x720 units) shows its name in the middle
  of the screen: Game.exe draws the name plate around x 641 (0x45fd4b /
  0x45fda9, plus the offset ScrWork[2784] that no script sets), while the
  upstream formula put the name at x 1620 (1080p).
- NametagType.CenteredTwoPiece: two sprites on both sides of the drawn name,
  centred on NametagPosition.x: left at x - NametagSideOffsets.x - (name width
  + NametagSidePadding) / 2, right at x + NametagSideOffsets.y + (name width +
  NametagSidePadding) / 2, both at NametagPosition.y. The name width is the
  extent of the laid out name glyphs.

Generic; can go upstream.

Verified on MuMu (Android 15 x86_64 emulator, not a real device): sg0-pc
names of one to four characters centred at the bottom of the message window
between the two brush strokes of MESWIN, prologue to SG0_B01_12; sg-pc names
unchanged (bottom right).

diff --git a/src/hud/nametagdisplay.cpp b/src/hud/nametagdisplay.cpp
index f7817af0b59639a04db3585a28db16c9ade19f5c..039e5cede921ad1b3d4a4eb8b659b511c13ab353 100644
--- a/src/hud/nametagdisplay.cpp
+++ b/src/hud/nametagdisplay.cpp
@@ -5,6 +5,7 @@
 #include "cc/nametagdisplay.h"
 #include "../log.h"
 
+#include <algorithm>
 #include <numeric>
 
 namespace Impacto {
@@ -34,6 +35,9 @@ std::unique_ptr<NametagDisplay> NametagDisplay::Create() {
 
     case NametagType::CC:
       return std::make_unique<CC::NametagDisplay>();
+
+    case NametagType::CenteredTwoPiece:
+      return std::make_unique<CenteredTwoPieceNametagDisplay>();
   }
 }
 
@@ -86,4 +90,28 @@ void ThreePieceNametagDisplay::Render(const NameInfo& nameInfo,
                                   RendererOutlineMode::Full);
 }
 
+void CenteredTwoPieceNametagDisplay::Render(const NameInfo& nameInfo,
+                                            const glm::vec4 tint) {
+  if (Hidden || !nameInfo.RenderWindow || nameInfo.Name.empty()) return;
+
+  float left = nameInfo.Name.front().DestRect.X;
+  float right = left;
+  for (const ProcessedTextGlyph& glyph : nameInfo.Name) {
+    left = std::min(left, glyph.DestRect.X);
+    right = std::max(right, glyph.DestRect.X + glyph.DestRect.Width);
+  }
+  const float half = (right - left + NametagSidePadding) / 2.0f;
+  Renderer->DrawSprite(
+      NametagLeftSprite,
+      {NametagPosition.x - NametagSideOffsets.x - half, NametagPosition.y},
+      tint);
+  Renderer->DrawSprite(
+      NametagRightSprite,
+      {NametagPosition.x + NametagSideOffsets.y + half, NametagPosition.y},
+      tint);
+
+  DialogueFont->DrawProcessedText(nameInfo.Name, tint.a,
+                                  RendererOutlineMode::Full);
+}
+
 }  // namespace Impacto
